  "title": "Genfare Partners with Albany’s Capital District Transportation Authority on Forward-Thinking “Navigator” Fare Management Solution",
  "summary": "Genfare recently implemented Genfare Link®, a comprehensive, digital fare management platform, at the Capital District Transportation Authority (CDTA) in Albany, New York. CDTA’s solution, Navigator, allows riders to purchase fares through a variety of convenient channels. The cloud-based Genfare Link empowers the public transportation industry to keep pace with the digitization of today’s business world. […]",
